<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.9.6">
<l>maittuṉaṉmār kātaliyai mayirmuṭippit</l>
<l rend="indent">tavarkaḷaiyē maṉṉa rākki</l>
<l>yuttaraitaṉ ciṟuvaṉaiyu muyyakkoṇṭa</l>
<l rend="indent">vuyirāḷa ṉuṟaiyuṅ kōyil</l>
<l>pattarkaḷum pakavarkaḷum paḻamoḻivāy</l>
<l rend="indent">muṉivarkaḷum paranta nāṭuñ</l>
<l>cittarkaḷun toḻutiṟaiñcat ticaiviḷakkāy</l>
<l rend="indent">niṟkiṉṟa tiruva raṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The temple where dwells the ruler of [our] lives</l>
<l rend="indent">who took and rescued Uttarā’s boy,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] made [his] cousins kings</l>
<l rend="indent">[so that] their wife was able to tie up [her] hair</l>
<l>is in holy Araṅkam which stands as a lamp to [all] directions,</l>
<l rend="indent">as bhaktas, bhagavas, sages [learned] in the ancient words,</l>
<l rend="indent">the [entire] vast country, and the siddhas</l>
<l rend="indent">[all] prostrate, worshipping [him].</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
